{"id":"d9aaf109dea18156","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal.md","title":"移动标记的全延伸／不可延伸二分","display":"lem-marker-extension-diagonal — 移动标记的全延伸／不可延伸二分","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal","aliases":["20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal"],"display":"lem-marker-extension-diagonal — 移动标记的全延伸／不可延伸二分","chapter":"4","section":"4.3.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 4.3.12；Remark 4.3.8 的完整构造","source_printed_pages":[89,91],"source_pdf_pages":[125,127],"depends_on":["[[20-df-movable-markers]]","[[20-thm-sigma3-representation]]","[[20-df-ext]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-lem-padding]]","[[20-df-cof]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-marker-extension-diagonal — 移动标记的全延伸／不可延伸二分"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.3.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 4.3.12；Remark 4.3.8 的完整构造"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89</span><span>91</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>125</span><span>127</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" href=\"?note=466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" title=\"20-df-movable-markers\">20-df-movable-markers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6b18750fb01771e3\" href=\"?note=6b18750fb01771e3\" title=\"20-thm-sigma3-representation\">20-thm-sigma3-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"42a23ade1ce9e8e9\" href=\"?note=42a23ade1ce9e8e9\" title=\"20-df-ext\">20-df-ext</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ddc81bc510c82f3e\" href=\"?note=ddc81bc510c82f3e\" title=\"20-df-cof\">20-df-cof</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\Sigma_3^0\">\\(S\\in\\Sigma_3^0\\)</span>；由行表示取全可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in S\">\\(x\\in S\\)</span> 时某行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{g(x,i)}\">\\(W_{g(x,i)}\\)</span> 无限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin S\">\\(x\\notin S\\)</span> 时每行有限。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" href=\"?note=466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" title=\"20-df-movable-markers\">20-df-movable-markers</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6b18750fb01771e3\" href=\"?note=6b18750fb01771e3\" title=\"20-thm-sigma3-representation\">20-thm-sigma3-representation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"42a23ade1ce9e8e9\" href=\"?note=42a23ade1ce9e8e9\" title=\"20-df-ext\">20-df-ext</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cof}=\\{e:\\omega\\setminus W_e\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cof}=\\{e:\\omega\\setminus W_e\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}\\)</span> 为全可计算延伸的指标集。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"ddc81bc510c82f3e\" href=\"?note=ddc81bc510c82f3e\" title=\"20-df-cof\">20-df-cof</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}marker-extension-diagonal}\\vdash\n\\exists p:\\omega\\to\\omega\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\np\\text{ 全可计算且单射}\\land\\forall x\\ \\operatorname{ran}(\\varphi_{p(x)})\\subseteq2,\\\\\nx\\in S\\Rightarrow p(x)\\in\\mathrm{Cof}\\cap\\mathrm{Ext},\\\\\nx\\notin S\\Rightarrow p(x)\\notin\\mathrm{Ext}.\n\\end{gathered}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}marker-extension-diagonal}\\vdash\n\\exists p:\\omega\\to\\omega\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\np\\text{ 全可计算且单射}\\land\\forall x\\ \\operatorname{ran}(\\varphi_{p(x)})\\subseteq2,\\\\\nx\\in S\\Rightarrow p(x)\\in\\mathrm{Cof}\\cap\\mathrm{Ext},\\\\\nx\\notin S\\Rightarrow p(x)\\notin\\mathrm{Ext}.\n\\end{gathered}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 构造部分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_s=\\operatorname{dom}(\\psi_s)\">\\(B_s=\\operatorname{dom}(\\psi_s)\\)</span>，并给每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 一个尚未服务的标志。阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+1\">\\(s+1\\)</span> 用同一快照取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_i(s)\">\\(b_i(s)\\)</span>，只处理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\le s\">\\(i\\le s\\)</span>：若第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 行新增元素，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_i(s)\">\\(b_i(s)\\)</span> 上定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi=0\">\\(\\psi=0\\)</span>；否则若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 未服务且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{i,s}(b_i(s))=y\">\\(\\varphi_{i,s}(b_i(s))=y\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi(b_i(s))=1-\\min(1,y)\">\\(\\psi(b_i(s))=1-\\min(1,y)\\)</span> 并将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 标为已服务。不同 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 的位置不同，位置均未定义，所以这是单值有效枚举。若某行无限，它无穷次删除第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个补集位置，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_i(s)\\to\\infty\">\\(b_i(s)\\to\\infty\\)</span>，最终补集至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个；有限补集可硬编码，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 有二值全可计算延伸。若各行有限，则对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span>，位置改变只可能来自编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\le i\">\\(j\\le i\\)</span> 的有限行事件或各自一次服务；因此所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_i\">\\(b_i\\)</span> 最终稳定。任何全 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_i\">\\(\\varphi_i\\)</span> 最终在其稳定位置停机，若还未服务便服务，留下与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_i\">\\(\\varphi_i\\)</span> 不同的永久值；若早已服务，永久反例已存在。因此没有全可计算延伸。s-m-n 和 padding 给单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>。全构造可以相对任意固定 oracle，替换阶段关系和 c.e. 行即可。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 4.3.12；Remark 4.3.8 的完整构造；印刷页 89, 91；PDF 第 125, 127 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-movable-markers","status":"resolved","id":"466c9d0fec2ff1b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-movable-markers]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-sigma3-representation","status":"resolved","id":"6b18750fb01771e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-sigma3-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-ext","status":"resolved","id":"42a23ade1ce9e8e9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-ext]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-padding","status":"resolved","id":"743a0376168bb7ec","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-padding]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cof","status":"resolved","id":"ddc81bc510c82f3e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cof]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-movable-markers","status":"resolved","id":"466c9d0fec2ff1b3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-movable-markers]]；see [[20-thm-sigma3-representation]]；see [[20-df-ext]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-sigma3-representation","status":"resolved","id":"6b18750fb01771e3","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-movable-markers]]；see [[20-thm-sigma3-representation]]；see [[20-df